@identityBaseUrl = http://localhost:5090
@accessToken = replace-with-superadmin-access-token
@tenantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@grantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Create a read-only break-glass grant
POST {{identityBaseUrl}}/api/identity/break-glass
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "reason": "Investigate a production incident affecting customer access",
  "durationMinutes": 30
}

### Exchange credentials and grant for a tenant-scoped break-glass token
POST {{identityBaseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=urn%3Amks%3Abreak-glass&username=admin%40example.com&password=replace-me&tenant_id={{tenantId}}&grant_id={{grantId}}

### Revoke the grant
DELETE {{identityBaseUrl}}/api/identity/break-glass/{{grantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
